This distribution includes a six-state control engine, a C++20 twin, Python
governors and shields, and simulation harnesses for documented Kubernetes
HPA / Cluster Autoscaler / metrics-server behaviour.

This is not the upstream Kubernetes, Cluster Autoscaler, or Karpenter
binaries. Results in this repository are simulation and recorded-trace
replays unless a file explicitly says otherwise.

